	"general": {
		"title": "Paint the Town",
		"pubDate": "2026-10-16T21:00:07Z",
		"link": "https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/669505296465396531",
		"source": "steam",
		"html": "<img src=\"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/8c5131174ced00e11e346cc1c3cb4d7c69013370.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /><br /><br />Brush in hand, Violet approaches the ritual with the same precision she does her art, wielding <i>Living Ink</i> that both empowers her bullets, and draws mere inspiration into reality. When entering <i>Flow State</i>, her ink glides easily, weaving towards danger to deal damage, or away from it to make a quick getaway. By creating a <i>Still Life</i> Violet can truly capture her enemies' likeness to stunning results. And with <i>Abstract Landscape</i> she surrounds herself and those nearby with her biggest and most ambitious piece yet, leaving onlookers completely speechless. - <i>\"I worked too hard to get here, I can't stop now.\"</i><br /><br />Violet is available in-game now! Which means that our final hero - Nurse Harrow - will be joining us <b>Next Tuesday October 20th at 2pm PDT</b>. We want to thank everyone for participating in voting once again, and we'll see you next week for the culmination of our <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.playdeadlock.com%2Fcityneversleeps\">City Never Sleeps</a> update. Have a good weekend!"
	},
